-You know?

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.616 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:12.885 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Oh. Thank you very much.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:15.488 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:19.359 line:92%
And, you know, it gets --

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:21.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
The song, you know,
